  "implementation": [
    "Raw UTF16LE Memo roundtrip and opaque OLE; NULL/empty distinct; explicit inline/single/chained choice and small-value external fallback based on completed ordinary record capacity.",
    "LVAL append owner marker distinct from ordinary table owner/hidden target; one EOF sequence and aggregated role-map bytes compose chunks and parent forwarding.",
    "Final authority rebinds immutable original table/column/requests, actual original root frames, expected and new values, and writable ownership independently of staged Roots/metadata.",
    "Independent original-state map replay derives exact failed-fit clears/EOF bits; page/value/descriptor/chunk audits protect old bodies, masks, gaps, padding and zero new-page initialization.",
    "Append-aware finalizer returns owned preview directly and retains equal-length normal apply/journal paths."
  ],
